"""Runs the local check gate's tiers (D-061) at milestone gates and where D-084 asks.

    tools/check [check]              milestone gates, and changes that need the workstation
    tools/check full                 milestone gates; toolchain, dependency and packaging changes
    tools/check spark --host HOST    milestone gates, and changes that need its Spark sanitizer builds
    tools/check TIER --list          the tier's steps, without running them

`mise run check`, `mise run check:full` and `mise run check:spark -- --host
HOST` run these. `check` checks formatting, REUSE compliance, embedded
license headers and the portability boundaries (tools/llmp_boundaries.py),
runs the tooling tests, builds and tests the native,
CPU-only and cross presets (cross under qemu-user), then runs clang-tidy. `full` adds the sanitizer builds, the offline,
copyleft-disabled build in the reference container, the arm64 package with
its inventory and install test, and the confined-job proof. `spark` deploys the
cross, cross-asan and cross-tsan builds to HOST and runs their tests there,
GPU tests and leak detection included. Every build is --locked (tools/build),
the core profile from locked sources only, and configured afresh, so nothing
set in a build directory's cache carries into it. The steps never see the
caller's compiler, CMake, test or sanitizer settings (IGNORED_ENV).

Every step runs even if an earlier one failed. The summary gives each step's
result with the host, commit and SDK, for the handoff note (workflow.md).
"""

